  // exterior regions to this same file.
  //
  // Four fields are deliberately left unset on every row and each is a forward reference, not an
  // omission. Filling them here would make this file the source of truth for a table another task
  // owns, and `validate_world.py` rule 6 cannot check any of them until that table exists:
  //
  //   floorMaterial / wallMaterial / ceilingMaterial   HOUSE-00385 authors §22.2's material table
