  //   daylight.windowIds                               HOUSE-00374..HOUSE-00379 author the portals
  //   acoustic.roomTone                                HOUSE-00397 authors the ambience beds
  //
  // `footstepSurface`, `acoustic.absorption`, `thermal` and `residencyPack` ARE authored: they are
  // properties of the room as experienced (§22.3) and nothing else declares them.
  "schema": "cna-house/cells/1",

